el druid-data-nonempty\">\nA</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SupportedWeather(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"LevelInformation\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SupportedWeather(s)\">Supported Weather(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SupportedWeather(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nRainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, Minefield</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Technical\">Technical</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorSizeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorSizeMultiplier\">Interior Size Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorSizeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n1.2</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorsSpawnChances\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorsSpawnChances\">Interiors Spawn Chances</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorsSpawnChances druid-data-nonempty\">\nFacility: 0.0001%<br />Mansion: 0.03%<br />Mineshaft: 0.0001%<br />Atlantean Citadel: 0.001%<br />Carnival: 0.0001%<br /><b>Greenhouse: 99.96%</b><br />Rubber Rooms: 0.004%</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MinimumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MinimumScrap\">Minimum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MinimumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n25</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaximumScrap\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaximumScrap\">Maximum Scrap</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaximumScrap druid-data-nonempty\">\n30</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-SpikeTraps\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-SpikeTraps\">Spike Traps</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-SpikeTraps druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 0</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Turrets\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Turrets\">Turrets</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Turrets druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Landmines\" data-druid-section-row=\"Technical\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Landmines\">Landmines</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Landmines druid-data-nonempty\">\n0 &#8594; 6</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Entities\">Entities</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantIndoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Indoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantIndoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nHoarding Bug, Bunker Spider, Hygrodere, Snare Flea</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DominantOutdoorEntity(s)\">Dominant Outdoor Entity(s)</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DominantOutdoorEntity(s) druid-data-nonempty\">\nCircuit Bees, Forest Keeper, Honey Stinger</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DaytimePower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DaytimePower\">Daytime Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DaytimePower druid-data-nonempty\">\n12</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-ExteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-ExteriorPower\">Exterior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-ExteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n14</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InteriorPower\" data-druid-section-row=\"Entities\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InteriorPower\">Interior Power</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InteriorPower druid-data-nonempty\">\n14</div></div></div></div>\n<div class=\"tocleft\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Map\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Map</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Info\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Info</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Environment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Environment</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Exterior_Ambience\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Exterior Ambience</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Weather\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Weather</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Progression\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Progression</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Unlocked_By\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocked By</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Unlocks\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unlocks</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Loot_Table\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Loot Table</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Entities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Entities</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Interior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Interior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Exterior)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Exterior)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Enemy_Spawns_(Daytime_Enemies)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Enemy Spawns (Daytime Enemies)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Lore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Lore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#&gt;_Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">&gt; Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>The moon of <b>Spine</b> is mostly oceanic, being covered in many smaller islands housing their own land based ecosystems. Due to the nature of the island's history it was found that the soil is greatly beneficial to the plants which root themselves in the dirt. The high concentrations of Haemoglobin in the environment from ancient leviathans making it their final resting place causing a slight discoloration witin the plants themselves.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Map\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Map\">&gt; Moon Map</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Info\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Info\">&gt; Moon Info</span></h2>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\"><b>POPULATION:</b> Abandoned.<br /><br /><b>CONDITIONS:</b> Warm, rich, high concentration of hemoglobin in local fosilised formations.<br /><br /><b>FAUNA:</b> A stable ecosystem, dominated by insects.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Environment\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Environment\">&gt; Environment</span></h2>\n<p><b>Spine</b> is an island surrounded by ocean. Most of the island is a tropical forest with several trees and foliage with an orangish tint, while outskirts of the island are sandy beaches with palm trees. True to its name, there also also several fossilized leviathan spines and ribcages scattered around the island. A colossal fossil can be seen southeast from the ship and can be walked on, though it leads nowhere.\n</p><p>Multiple bridges can be found on the exterior as well as three greenhouses, which are the main entrance and fire exits. Some of the aforementioned fossils can be used as bridges or staircases as well. The main entrance greenhouse can be accessed by going west and slightly south of the ship up a hill to a bridge, a fire exit is located far to the south and slightly to the west on the outskirts of the island, and the other fire exit is to the east on the beach.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Exterior_Ambience\">Exterior Ambience</span></h3>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"61\" data-mwtitle=\"Junic_outside.wav\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/Junic_outside.wav?4d0fc5\" type=\"audio/wav\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Junic_outside.wav/Junic_outside.wav.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/Junic_outside.wav/Junic_outside.wav.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-transcodekey=\"mp3\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Weather\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Weather\">&gt; Weather</span></h2>\n<p><b>Spine</b> supports Rainy, Stormy, Foggy, Eclipsed, Earthquakes, Forsaken, Hallowed, Hurricane, and Minefield weather by default.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Moon_Exclusive_Content\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Moon_Exclusive_Content\">&gt; Moon Exclusive Content</span></h2>\n<p><b>Spine</b> does not contain any notable exclusive content or mechanics, though it does have the highest chance of spawning the <a href=\"/wiki/Greenhouse\" title=\"Greenhouse\"><b>Greenhouse</b></a> interior alongside <a href=\"/wiki/Faith\" title=\"Faith\"><b>Faith</b></a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Progression\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Progression\">&gt; Progression</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocked_By\">Unlocked By</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span>Crafting a <b>Blank floppy disc</b> on <a href=\"/wiki/Galetry\" title=\"Galetry\"><b>Galetry</b></a>, inserting it into the <b>Floppy disc machine</b> on the exterior of <a href=\"/wiki/Chasm\" title=\"Chasm\"><b>Chasm</b></a>, and logging <b>Spine floppy disc</b>.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Unlocks\">Unlocks</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"spoiler-content\" style=\"\"><span><a href=\"/wiki/ResearcherxB\" title=\"ResearcherxB\"><big><b>ResearcherxB:</b></big></a> <b>Spine</b> can be one of the random moons that requires placing a <b>Triangulation device</b> on its exterior.</span></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Loot_Table\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Loot_Table\">&gt; Loot Table</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expand