back towards the island and underneath where the ship is. The interior can be accessed from the exterior by doing this as well.</li></ul>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpineMainbridge.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The bridge leading to the main entrance.\"><img alt=\"The bridge leading to the main entrance.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpineMainbridge.jpg/120px-SpineMainbridge.jpg?2e62ca\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpineMainbridge.jpg/180px-SpineMainbridge.jpg?2e62ca 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpineMainbridge.jpg/240px-SpineMainbridge.jpg?2e62ca 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The bridge leading to the main entrance.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SpineFireSW.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The south and slightly west fire exit.\"><img alt=\"The south and slightly west fire exit.\" src=\"/images/thumb/SpineFireSW.jpg/120px-SpineFireSW.jpg?b15f88\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/SpineFireSW.jpg/180px-SpineFireSW.jpg?b15f88 1.5x, /images/thumb/SpineFireSW.jpg/240px-SpineFireSW.jpg?b15f88 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The south and slightly west fire exit.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:1